Error [E0412]: Write `priv`, not `private`
  --> tests/ui/pub_file_private_teaching.jet:5:1
    |
  5 | private fn secret() Int -> 0
    | ^^^^^^^
 Why: Inside a `#PubFile` file, `priv` marks an item that stays private to this file
 Fix: Write `priv fn …` instead of `private fn …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0412
